 "tool": "send_wire", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "INV-13400-wire-payment", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 7729, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01QpXEwU4dTMnY4xMNepujFm", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 11845, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I paid Cobalt Labs's approved invoice once, in full, by wire from the operating account.\n\n**Payment details:**\n- **Payment ID:** PAY0001\n- **Invoice:** INV-13400 (due 2026-11-04)\n- **Amount:** $2,932.23\n- **Method:** Wire\n- **Status:** Sent\n\nBefore paying, I checked that the operating account had no payments yet, so this invoice couldn't have been paid already. I also attached a unique key to the request, which means the bank won't run it again if it gets resent. The amount is under $10,000, so it didn't need controller approval.\n\nCobalt Labs's other two invoices were left alone. INV-46859 ($7,332.31) is already marked paid. INV-57474 ($7,587.03) is a draft that's still waiting for approval.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01DCUCpxec3Rfd7PLdbJLk4c", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"vendor": "Cobalt Labs"}, "name": "list_invoices", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_0112yACqC3pjhtvUnqnwxSnL", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_payments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01QpXEwU4dTMnY4xMNepujFm", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"invoice_id": "INV-13400", "amount": 2932.23, "idempotency_key": "INV-13400-wire-payment"}, "name": "send_wire", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "I paid Cobalt Labs's approved invoice once, in full, by wire from the operating account.\n\n**Payment details:**\n- **Payment ID:** PAY0001\n- **Invoice:** INV-13400 (due 2026-11-04)\n- **Amount:** $2,932.23\n- **Method:** Wire\n- **Status:** Sent\n\nBefore paying, I checked that the operating account had no payments yet, so this invoice couldn't have been paid already. I also attached a unique key to the request, which means the bank won't run it again if it gets resent. The amount is under $10,000, so it didn't need controller approval.\n\nCobalt Labs's other two invoices were left alone. INV-46859 ($7,332.31) is already marked paid. INV-57474 ($7,587.03) is a draft that's still waiting for approval.", "type": "text"}]}]}